WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.049 --> 00:00:03.818
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:03.819 --> 00:00:06.084
What do they see?

3
00:00:06.085 --> 00:00:09.421
They see a trampoline park.

4
00:00:09.422 --> 00:00:19.923
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:19.924 --> 00:00:31.701
They jump on the trampolines.

6
00:00:31.702 --> 00:00:39.035
They jump low.

7
00:00:39.036 --> 00:00:53.812
They jump from side to side.

8
00:00:53.813 --> 00:01:03.204
They jump high.

9
00:01:03.205 --> 00:01:15.934
They jump and spin.

10
00:01:15.935 --> 00:01:26.769
They jump far.

11
00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:32.498
They jump too much!

12
00:01:32.499 --> 00:01:44.371
Blobs, be careful!

13
00:01:44.372 --> 00:01:49.972
Silly blobs!

14
00:01:49.973 --> 00:01:56.960
Good-bye!

